  "claim_boundary": "This P0044 mixed-partition transfer cohort is frozen after P0043 and before any selected task grid is parsed, visualized, scored, or used for operator design. Selection reads only benchmark labels, split names, and filenames; selected source JSON bytes are recorded only as opaque SHA-256 integrity commitments and are not decoded by this freezer. It excludes every P0042 predecessor import plus the P0042 mixed-partition roster itself under the conservative global task-ID policy. It uses 20 ARC1 evaluation filenames and 20 ARC2 training filenames because P0041 exhausted ARC1 all-training capacity and ARC2 evaluation capacity was previously exhausted. It is fresh transfer evidence for this explicitly mixed-partition internal protocol, remains non-comparable to all-training transfer, and is forbidden from benchmark-submission claims.",
